        <mxCell id="lRD6Wx8wFjBgip5wHSY7-57" value="Note:&amp;nbsp;&lt;div&gt;- Instead of using array maybe use classes and attributes&lt;div&gt;-&amp;gt; should be more performance optimized&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;--&amp;gt; class: dataset&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;---&amp;gt; attributes: e.g. dataset.accelerationX1&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Logging optional depending on uC performance&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- All Status changes should be communicated with telemetry&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;- Instead of Booleans use Status byte&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;and check for status byte&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255));&quot;&gt;- Some if blocks are secondary and uncritical and are therefore evaluated outside the main branch&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
