        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="m2oRSrEeqgmuoLIzp4l1-1" value="Statusbyte structure (should be send to telemetry at the beginning of each loop):&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;1 byte (char)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;States:&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0000 (0): Pad Idle&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0001 (1): Armed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0010 (2): Liftoff detected&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0011 (3): Booster Burnout/Coasting&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0100 (4): Apogee detected&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0101 (5): Pyro1 signal sent (drogue)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0110 (6): Pyro2 signal sent (drogue)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 0111 (7): Pyro3 signal sent (drogue)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1000 (8): Pyro4 signal sent (drogue)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1001 (9):&amp;nbsp; Drogue deployment detected&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1010 (10): Pyro1 signal sent (main)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1011 (11): Pyro2 signal sent&amp;nbsp; (main)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1100 (12): Pyro3 signal sent (main)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1101 (13): Pyro4 signal sent (main)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1110 (14): Main deployment detected&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;0000 1111 (15): Landed&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;maybe safe two pyro statuses per parachute (at most two channels per parachute)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;able to add continuity checks&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-290" y="455" width="340" height="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
